{"id": "EUVD-2026-101946", "enisaUuid": "985b2084-981b-3c2f-8e05-0dce2f349246", "description": "In Eclipse Jetty, HttpClient may receive a redirect of the form:\n\n\n\n```\n\n\n\n/secure/../evil\n\n\n\n```\n\n\n\nIf an attacker is able to control the redirects, then HttpClient matches authentication credentials against `/secure` rather than normalizing the path to `/evil`, and will therefore follow the redirect sending the `Authorization` header for `/secure` to `/evil`.\n\n\n\nThis also mean that the attacker must have an evil application deployed on the same domain as the target.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T08:46:54", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T13:51:45", "baseScore": 8.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/jetty/jetty.project/security/advisories/GHSA-qfr2-43g5-g768", "https://gitlab.eclipse.org/security/cve-assignment/-/work_items/236"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-76184", "GHSA-j5fg-j6xp-mjwf"], "assigner": "eclipse", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "36eee0a9-eb20-3116-afb5-0b8751e9db50", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "12.0.0 \u226412.0.38"}, {"id": "4f7275f0-4473-35b3-9d19-7c02c3851aeb", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "11.0.0 \u226411.0.32"}, {"id": "579f8dff-669f-3a5c-851a-3c491e56e3a7", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "9.4.0 \u22649.4.64"}, {"id": "91f3685a-b11c-3e57-a60f-3daba90fafcd", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "10.0.0 \u226410.0.32"}, {"id": "e191a169-7a52-3560-8100-b7ee370e786a", "product": {"name": "Eclipse Jetty", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "12.1.0 \u226412.1.12"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a9ff0a0e-7e9d-3802-bc99-2eb30bfe5b37", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}